<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="images/favicon.png" type="">
  <title>ย้ายเว็บไซต์แล้ว — The View</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #e0e0e0;

      /* 🔥 Background Image */
      background: url("/images/bg-2.jpg") no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
    }

    /* Dark overlay to improve text contrast */
    .overlay {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .moved-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      background: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.92);
      padding: 40px 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .moved-icon {
      font-size: 44px;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .moved-card h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .moved-card p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #cfcfcf;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
    }

    .moved-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: #4a90e2;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
    }

    .moved-btn:hover {
      background: #357abd;
    }

    .moved-btn:active {
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    .moved-url {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9aa4ad;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .moved-url a {
      color: #9aa4ad;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="overlay">
    <div class="moved-card">
      <div class="moved-icon">🔒</div>

      <h1>ย้ายเว็บไซต์แล้ว</h1>

      <p>
        ระบบจองโต๊ะได้ย้ายไปยังที่อยู่ใหม่<br>
        กรุณาคลิกปุ่มด้านล่างเพื่อไปยังเว็บไซต์ใหม่
      </p>

      <a class="moved-btn"
         href="https://theview-table-book-production-c508.up.railway.app">
        ไปที่เว็บไซต์ใหม่ &nbsp;&rarr;
      </a>

      <span class="moved-url">
        <a href="https://theview-table-book-production-c508.up.railway.app">
          theview-table-book-production-c508.up.railway.app
        </a>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
